<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 01:29:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>劳动力市场可能变得如此落后，以至于经济将不得不裁员以保持失业率稳定</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/the-labor-market-could-become-so-backward-that-the-economy-will-have-to-shed-jobs-to-keep-unemployment-steady/</link><description>“如今，劳动力市场的速度限制远低于几年前，为失业扩张奠定了基础。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2273897892-e1785621366556.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 23:15:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/the-labor-market-could-become-so-backward-that-the-economy-will-have-to-shed-jobs-to-keep-unemployment-steady/</guid></item><item><title>由于担心伊朗的网络攻击，密歇根州与明尼苏达州一起报告黑客针对供水系统进行攻击。目前FBI正在调查</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/iranian-cyberattacks-michigan-minnesota-hackers-water-systems-fbi/</link><description>本周早些时候，当局表示网络攻击针对的是明尼苏达州的 30 多个供水系统。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26211784682407-e1785620359574.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 21:47:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/iranian-cyberattacks-michigan-minnesota-hackers-water-systems-fbi/</guid></item><item><title>皮罗承认反射池损坏是由于安装不当造成的，并指责内政部不分享信息后，特朗普对皮罗进行了猛烈抨击</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-us-attorney-jeanine-pirro-reflecting-pool-damage-installation-vandals-interior-dept/</link><description>皮罗办公室在周五提交的一份法庭文件中，决定撤销对前奥运选手大卫·赫恩的刑事指控，后者被指控故意破坏泳池。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26210668281669-e1785618671940.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 21:19:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-us-attorney-jeanine-pirro-reflecting-pool-damage-installation-vandals-interior-dept/</guid></item><item><title>美联储主席凯文·沃什谈论了一场大戏，但这个市场指标将告诉你在他造成“信誉冲击”后华尔街是否信任他</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/fed-chair-kevin-warsh-credibility-shock-rate-hikes-inflation-yield-curve/</link><description>“最重要的是，美联储可信度的一个重要部分不仅仅是说它有某些目标，而且还在于解释它将如何实现这些目标。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287530714-e1785610051560.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:27:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/fed-chair-kevin-warsh-credibility-shock-rate-hikes-inflation-yield-curve/</guid></item><item><title>在欧盟国家警告“不受控制的大规模越境”后，西班牙在休达和摩洛哥之间设置了1,600英尺的海障</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/spain-sea-barrier-ceuta-morocco-eu-states-uncontrolled-mass-crossings/</link><description>意大利总理乔治亚·梅洛尼也威胁要暂停意大利与西班牙的开放边境申根协议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288489329-e1785607822830.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 18:18:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/spain-sea-barrier-ceuta-morocco-eu-states-uncontrolled-mass-crossings/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在宣布其“反武器化基金”死亡一天后发誓要恢复该基金，而蒂利斯则将其抨击为“朋克的赔钱锅”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-anti-weaponization-fund-acting-attorney-general-todd-blanche-thom-tillis-payout-pot-punks/</link><description>特朗普还在他的《真相社会》帖子中声称，他将继续担任代理司法部长托德·布兰奇目前的职务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26212719114505-e1785606732943.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 18:01:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/trump-anti-weaponization-fund-acting-attorney-general-todd-blanche-thom-tillis-payout-pot-punks/</guid></item><item><title>欢迎来到大型战争：中东和欧洲冲突融合，沿途卷入了更多国家——甚至包括那些声称中立的国家</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/iran-ukraine-mega-war-mideast-european-conflicts-merge-russia-nato-egypt-saudi-coalition/</link><description>“伊朗和乌克兰的战争可能是相互关联的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9840392-e1785600620298.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 17:24:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/iran-ukraine-mega-war-mideast-european-conflicts-merge-russia-nato-egypt-saudi-coalition/</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克(Elon Musk)的财富在暴跌后跌至SpaceX IPO前的水平</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/elon-musk-net-worth-spacex-stock-rout-spcx-tesla-shares/</link><description>马斯克的财富在6月16日达到约1.33万亿美元的峰值，目前为6840亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2216843063-e1785597368842.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 15:19:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/elon-musk-net-worth-spacex-stock-rout-spcx-tesla-shares/</guid></item><item><title>埃克森美孚、雪佛龙警告称，由于战争影响炼油业，燃油价格将持续上涨</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/exxon-chevron-fuel-prices-diesel-gasoline-refining-capacity/</link><description>尽管西德克萨斯中质原油价格下跌了 26%，但零售汽油价格仅比今年 5 月份的峰值低 10%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2276970130-e1785596831550.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 15:12:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/exxon-chevron-fuel-prices-diesel-gasoline-refining-capacity/</guid></item><item><title>Bessent 加入日本，帮助扭转日元数月跌势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/scott-bessent-treasury-japan-yen-dollar-exchange-rate/</link><description>目前两国之间的协调程度似乎是几十年来最紧密的，这加大了做空日元的交易者的赌注。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286452776-e1785596222971.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 15:05:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/scott-bessent-treasury-japan-yen-dollar-exchange-rate/</guid></item></channel></rss>